# Stilwell Farms - placeable farm buildings (FARM set). 3/4 top-down, top-left light, dark outlines.
# Generated from a semantic-colour sketch; each 8x8 tile is solved to ONE palette (see palmap).
# Grass = exact GRASS pixels (G palette). Green standing-seam metal (roofs, silo dome, mill cap) is drawn in
# G tiles so hips, domes and gables sit on real grass. Doors / openings touch the bottom edge.

